---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Classification Scientifique — Meliponini">
    <main class="page-family">
        <div class="container-text">
            <h1 class="page-title">Classification scientifique</h1>

            <div class="content-block">
                <p>
                    Dans la classification entomologique des abeilles, la
                    famille
                    <strong>APIDAE</strong> est très vaste.
                </p>
                <p>
                    À l’intérieur de cette famille, la sous-famille
                    <strong>APINAE</strong> regroupe plusieurs tribus, mais quatre
                    sont particulièrement reconnues et représentatives, dont
                    <strong>APINI</strong> et <strong>MELIPONINI</strong> les seules
                    capables de produire du miel :
                </p>

                <ul class="classification-list">
                    <li>
                        <span class="tribe">APINI</span>
                        <span class="separator">→</span>
                        <span class="desc"
                            >les abeilles mellifères, Apis mellifera.</span
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="tribe">MELIPONINI</span>
                        <span class="separator">→</span>
                        <span class="desc"
                            >les abeilles sans aiguillon du genre Melipona,
                            Scaptotrigona, Plebeia..</span
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="tribe">BOMBINI</span>
                        <span class="separator">→</span>
                        <span class="desc">les bourdons, Bombus.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="tribe">EUGLOSSINI</span>
                        <span class="separator">→</span>
                        <span class="desc"
                            >les abeilles à longues langues, dites « abeilles
                            des orchidées » des abeilles de couleurs brillantes,
                            souvent métalliques, du genre Euglossa, Eulaema,
                            Exaerete..</span
                        >
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <!-- ARBORESCENCE (Tree) -->
                <div class="taxonomy-wrapper">
                    <div class="taxonomy">
                        <div class="levels">
                            <div class="level">Famille</div>
                            <div class="level">Sous-famille</div>
                            <div class="level">Tribu</div>
                            <div class="level">Genre</div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="tree">
                            <div class="node-text root">APIDAE</div>
                            <div class="line-vertical"></div>
                            <div class="node-text">APINAE</div>

                            <div class="branch">
                                <div class="subtree">
                                    <div class="node-text tribe">APINI</div>
                                    <div class="line-vertical-small"></div>
                                    <button
                                        class="node-btn box open-modal-famille"
                                        data-famille-id="apis">Apis</button
                                    >
                                </div>

                                <div class="subtree">
                                    <div class="node-text tribe">
                                        MELIPONINI
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="line-vertical-small"></div>
                                    <div class="stack">
                                        <button
                                            class="node-btn box open-modal-famille"
                                            data-famille-id="melipona"
                                            >Melipona</button
                                        >
                                        <button
                                            class="node-btn box open-modal-famille"
                                            data-famille-id="tetragonisca"
                                            >Tetragonisca</button
                                        >
                                        <button
                                            class="node-btn box open-modal-famille"
                                            data-famille-id="scaptotrigona"
                                            >Scaptotrigona</button
                                        >
                                        <button
                                            class="node-btn box open-modal-famille"
                                            data-famille-id="plebeia"
                                            >Plebeia</button
                                        >
                                        <button
                                            class="node-btn box open-modal-famille"
                                            data-famille-id="cephalotrigona"
                                            >Cephalotrigona</button
                                        >
                                        <button
                                            class="node-btn box"
                                            disabled
                                            style="opacity: 0.5;"
                                            >Friesomelitta</button
                                        >
                                        <button
                                            class="node-btn box"
                                            disabled
                                            style="opacity: 0.5;"
                                            >Tetragona</button
                                        >
                                        <button
                                            class="node-btn box"
                                            disabled
                                            style="opacity: 0.5;"
                                            >Trigona</button
                                        >
                                        <button
                                            class="node-btn box"
                                            disabled
                                            style="opacity: 0.5;"
                                            >Leurotrigona</button
                                        >
                                        <button
                                            class="node-btn box"
                                            disabled
                                            style="opacity: 0.5;"
                                            >Nannotrigona</button
                                        >
                                        <button
                                            class="node-btn box"
                                            disabled
                                            style="opacity: 0.5;"
                                            >Duckeola</button
                                        >
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- GRAPHIQUE CHART.JS -->
                <div class="chart-container" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
                    <div style="max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto;">
                        <canvas
                            id="beeChart"
                            style="width: 100%; height: 400px;"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Off-Canvas Modal (Elementor-style) -->
    <div
        id="family-canvas"
        class="e-off-canvas hidden"
        role="dialog"
        aria-hidden="true"
        aria-label="Famille Details"
        aria-modal="true"
    >
        <!-- Overlay -->
        <div id="canvas-overlay" class="e-off-canvas__overlay"></div>

        <!-- Main Container -->
        <div class="e-off-canvas__main">
            <!-- Content Wrapper -->
            <div class="e-off-canvas__content">
                <!-- Close Button (Top Right) -->
                <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 z-50">
                    <button
                        id="close-canvas"
                        class="bg-white/90 hover:bg-white text-gray-800 rounded-full p-2 shadow-lg transition-all"
                    >
                        <svg
                            class="h-6 w-6"
                            fill="none"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Header with Image -->
                <div class="relative h-64 bg-gray-100 flex-shrink-0">
                    <img
                        id="canvas-image"
                        src=""
                        alt=""
                        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                    />
                    <div
                        class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent"
                    >
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6">
                        <h2
                            id="canvas-title"
                            class="text-3xl font-bold text-white font-serif drop-shadow-lg"
                        >
                        </h2>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Content Body -->
                <div class="relative flex-1 px-6 py-6 sm:px-8 overflow-y-auto">
                    <div
                        id="canvas-content"
                        class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600 max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif prose-headings:text-gray-900 prose-strong:text-amber-800 prose-ul:list-disc prose-ul:pl-5"
                    >
                        <!-- Injected Content -->
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-12 mb-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-100">
                        <a
                            id="canvas-link"
                            href="#"
                            class="block w-full text-center px-6 py-4 border border-transparent rounded-xl shadow-sm text-base font-medium text-white bg-[#111] hover:bg-gray-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-gray-900 transition-all transform hover:scale-[1.02]"
                        >
                            Voir tous les produits
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SCRIPTS CHART.JS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js" is:inline></script>
    <script is:inline>
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
            const ctx = document.getElementById("beeChart").getContext("2d");
            if (!ctx) return;

            new Chart(ctx, {
                type: "bar",
                data: {
                    labels: [
                        "melipona",
                        "scaptotrigona",
                        "plebeia",
                        "trigona",
                        "paratrigona",
                        "partamona",
                        "trigonisca",
                        "lestrimelitta",
                        "geotrigona",
                        "tetragona",
                        "frieseomelitta",
                        "nannotrigona",
                        "oxytrigona",
                        "dolichotrigona",
                        "scaura",
                        "nanoplebia",
                        "nogueirapis",
                        "cephalotrigona",
                        "celetrigona",
                        "schwarziana",
                        "leurotrigona",
                        "tetragonisca",
                        "duckeola",
                        "schwarzula",
                        "trichotrigona",
                        "aparatrigona",
                        "friesella",
                        "mourella",
                    ],
                    datasets: [
                        {
                            label: "Espèces d'Amérique",
                            data: [
                                75, 47, 39, 34, 32, 31, 26, 22, 21, 20, 14, 14,
                                11, 10, 7, 7, 6, 5, 4, 4, 4, 4, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2,
                                1,
                            ],
                            backgroundColor: "#363748",
                            borderRadius: 2,
                        },
                        {
                            label: "Espèces du Brésil",
                            data: [
                                40, 16, 17, 22, 18, 21, 16, 13, 10, 15, 11, 8,
                                4, 6, 5, 2, 4, 2, 4, 4, 3, 3, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1,
                            ],
                            backgroundColor: "#9D9EAF",
                            borderRadius: 2,
                        },
                    ],
                },
                options: {
                    responsive: true,
                    maintainAspectRatio: false,
                    plugins: {
                        legend: {
                            display: true,
                            position: "top",
                            align: "start" /* Alignement légende gauche */,
                            labels: {
                                usePointStyle: true,
                                pointStyle: "circle",
                                padding: 20,
                                font: {
                                    family: "system-ui",
                                    size: 11,
                                },
                            },
                        },
                    },
                    scales: {
                        y: {
                            beginAtZero: true,
                            max: 80,
                            ticks: {
                                stepSize: 10,
                                font: {
                                    size: 11,
                                    family: "system-ui",
                                },
                            },
                            title: {
                                display: true,
                                text: "Nombre d'espèces",
                                color: "#D74E4E",
                                font: {
                                    family: "system-ui",
                                    weight: "bold",
                                },
                            },
                            grid: {
                                color: "#e5e5e5",
                            },
                            border: {
                                display: false,
                            },
                        },
                        x: {
                            title: {
                                display: true,
                                text: "28 Genres d'abeilles",
                                color: "#D74E4E",
                                font: {
                                    family: "system-ui",
                                    weight: "bold",
                                },
                            },
                            ticks: {
                                rotation: -45,
                                font: {
                                    size: 10,
                                    family: "system-ui",
                                },
                                autoSkip: false,
                            },
                            grid: {
                                display: false,
                            },
                            border: {
                                display: false,
                            },
                        },
                    },
                },
            });
        });
    </script>

    <!-- CANVAS INITIALIZATION -->
    <script is:inline>
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
            // Données des familles
            const familiesData = {
                apis: {
                    id: "apis",
                    name: "Apis",
                    link: "/categorie/apini/apis",
                    image: "/images/familles/apis.jpg",
                    content: `<h5>Le genre <strong>Apis mellifera</strong></h5>
                    <p>Comporte vingt-huit sous-espèces (toutes fécondables entre elles) réparties en cinq groupes majeurs...</p>`,
                },
                melipona: {
                    id: "melipona",
                    name: "Melipona",
                    link: "/categorie/meliponini/melipona",
                    image: "/images/familles/melipona.jpg",
                    content: `<p>Les <strong>Melipona</strong> sont un genre fascinant d'abeilles sans aiguillon...</p>`,
                },
                tetragonisca: {
                    id: "tetragonisca",
                    name: "Tetragonisca",
                    link: "/categorie/meliponini/tetragonisca",
                    image: "/images/familles/tetragonisca.jpg",
                    content: `<p>Genre : <strong>Tetragonisca</strong></p><p>Les Tetragonisca sont des abeilles mélipones...</p>`,
                },
                scaptotrigona: {
                    id: "scaptotrigona",
                    name: "Scaptotrigona",
                    link: "/categorie/meliponini/scaptotrigona",
                    image: "/images/familles/scaptotrigona.jpg",
                    content: `<p>Genre : <strong>Scaptotrigona</strong></p><p>Ce genre regroupe des abeilles robustes...</p>`,
                },
                plebeia: {
                    id: "plebeia",
                    name: "Plebeia",
                    link: "/categorie/meliponini/plebeia",
                    image: "/images/familles/plebeia.jpg",
                    content: `<p>Genre : <strong>Plebeia</strong></p><p>Les abeilles du genre Plebeia sont généralement de très petite taille...</p>`,
                },
                cephalotrigona: {
                    id: "cephalotrigona",
                    name: "Cephalotrigona",
                    link: "/categorie/meliponini/cephalotrigona",
                    image: "/images/familles/cephalotrigona.jpg",
                    content: `<p>Genre : <strong>Cephalotrigona</strong></p><p>Les Cephalotrigona, comme la "Mombucão"...</p>`,
                },
            };

            const canvas = document.getElementById("family-canvas");
            const overlay = document.getElementById("canvas-overlay");
            const closeBtn = document.getElementById("close-canvas");
            const openBtns = document.querySelectorAll(".open-modal-famille");

            const canvasTitle = document.getElementById("canvas-title");
            const canvasImage = document.getElementById("canvas-image");
            const canvasContent = document.getElementById("canvas-content");
            const canvasLink = document.getElementById("canvas-link");

            if (!canvas || !overlay) return;

            function openCanvas(familyId) {
                const family = familiesData[familyId];

                if (!family) {
                    console.error("Famille non trouvée:", familyId);
                    return;
                }

                if (canvasTitle) canvasTitle.textContent = family.name;
                if (canvasImage) {
                    canvasImage.src = family.image;
                    canvasImage.onerror = function () {
                        this.src = "https://placehold.co/600x400?text=Famille";
                    };
                }
                if (canvasContent) canvasContent.innerHTML = family.content;
                if (canvasLink) {
                    canvasLink.href = family.link;
                    canvasLink.textContent = `Explorer ${family.name}`;
                }

                canvas.classList.remove("hidden");
                canvas.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "false");
                canvas.classList.add("elementor-active");
                document.body.classList.add("elementor-offcanvas-active");
                document.body.style.overflow = "hidden";
            }

            function closeCanvasFunc() {
                canvas.classList.remove("elementor-active");
                canvas.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");
                document.body.classList.remove("elementor-offcanvas-active");

                setTimeout(() => {
                    canvas.classList.add("hidden");
                    document.body.style.overflow = "";
                }, 300);
            }

            openBtns.forEach((btn) => {
                btn.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
                    e.preventDefault();
                    const familyId = btn.getAttribute("data-famille-id");
                    if (familyId) {
                        openCanvas(familyId);
                    }
                });
            });

            closeBtn?.addEventListener("click", closeCanvasFunc);
            overlay?.addEventListener("click", closeCanvasFunc);

            document.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
                if (
                    e.key === "Escape" &&
                    !canvas.classList.contains("hidden")
                ) {
                    closeCanvasFunc();
                }
            });
        });
    </script>
</Layout>

<style>
    .page-family {
        padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 4rem);
        padding-bottom: 4rem;
        min-height: 80vh;
        background: #fff;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: flex-start; /* Alignement global à gauche */
    }

    .container-text {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 90vw; /* Élargissement du container */
        padding: 0 1rem;
        margin-left: 5vw; /* 5 unités du bord gauche */
        text-align: left;
    }

    /* TYPOGRAPHIE */
    .page-title {
        font-family: "abchannel", serif;
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2rem);
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: #000;
        text-align: center; /* Titre centré */
    }

    .content-block {
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #333;
    }

    .content-block p {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .content-block strong {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #000;
    }

    /* LISTE CLASSIFICATION */
    .classification-list {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 2rem 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .classification-list li {
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .tribe {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #000;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .separator {
        color: #999;
        font-weight: 300;
        margin: 0 0.5rem;
    }

    .desc {
        color: #555;
    }

    /* TABLETTE (max-width: 1024px) */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .page-family {
            padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 2rem);
        }

        .taxonomy-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0;
            margin-left: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .taxonomy {
            justify-content: center;
            min-width: 0 !important; /* Force l'écrasement */
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Réduction des textes Tablette */
        .node-btn {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            min-width: 100px;
        }
        .node-text {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
        .level {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            width: 120px;
        }

        /* Réduction de l'écart tablette */
        .branch {
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        /* Barre courte sur tablette */
        .branch::before {
            width: calc(100% - 100px);
            border-top: 1px solid #000;
        }

        /* ALIGNEMENT PRÉCIS TABLETTE (I et O) */

        /* 1. APINI (I) */
        .subtree:nth-child(1) .node-text.tribe {
            display: inline-block;
            transform: translateX(
                -11px
            ); /* Estimation initiale pour centrer le I */
        }
        .subtree:nth-child(1) .line-vertical-small {
            transform: translateX(-8px);
        }
        .subtree:nth-child(1) .node-btn {
            transform: translateX(-8px);
        }

        /* 2. MELIPONINI (O) */
        .subtree:nth-child(2) .node-text.tribe {
            display: inline-block;
            transform: translateX(
                17px
            ); /* Estimation initiale pour centrer le O */
        }
        .subtree:nth-child(2) .line-vertical-small {
            transform: translateX(22px);
        }
        .subtree:nth-child(2) .stack {
            margin-top: 0 !important;
            transform: translateX(22px);
        }
    }

    /* MOBILE (max-width: 768px) */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .classification-list li {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 0.2rem;
        }

        .separator {
            display: none;
        }

        /* Correction : Flèche uniqument dans la liste, PAS dans l'arbre */
        .classification-list .tribe::after {
            content: " →";
            color: #999;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* Container ajustement */
        .container-text {
            margin-left: 0;
            max-width: 100%;
            padding: 0 0.5rem; /* Encore moins de padding container */
        }

        /* Taxonomy Ultra Compact */
        .taxonomy-wrapper {
            margin-left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .taxonomy {
            justify-content: center;
            padding-left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            min-width: 0 !important; /* CRITIQUE : Overrides default 600px */
        }

        .levels {
            display: flex;
            margin-right: 0;
            padding-top: 0;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            width: 50px; /* Plus petit */
        }

        .level {
            width: 100%;
            font-size: 0.5rem; /* Minuscule */
            padding-left: 0;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            text-align: right;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding-right: 4px;
        }

        /* ARBRE */
        .tree {
            flex: 1;
            padding-left: 0;
            max-width: calc(100% - 50px);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .branch {
            gap: 6px;
            justify-content: center;
            width: auto;
        }

        .subtree {
            width: 80px; /* Réduit 85 -> 80 */
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* BARRE HORIZONTALE FIXE 
           Subtree center = 40px
           Gap = 6px
           Total center-center = 86px
        */
        .branch::before {
            width: 86px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            border-left: 1px solid #000;
            border-right: 1px solid #000;
            border-top: 1px solid #000;
            height: 12px;
            top: -12px;
        }

        /* Connecteur central (APINAE vers Barre) */
        .branch::after {
            top: -32px;
            height: 20px;
        }

        /* Réduction des tailles de polices et boites */
        .node-btn {
            min-width: unset;
            max-width: 76px; /* Suit la subtree */
            width: 95%;
            padding: 3px 2px; /* Micro padding */
            font-size: 0.6rem; /* Texte très petit */
            margin: 5px auto;
            white-space: normal;
            line-height: 1.05;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 4px !important;
        }

        .node-text {
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            margin: 4px auto;
            height: 25px; /* Moins haut */
        }

        /* Ajustements hauteurs */
        .line-vertical {
            height: 12px;
        }
        .line-vertical-small {
            height: 8px;
        }

        .level:nth-child(1) {
            height: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .level:nth-child(2) {
            height: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .level:nth-child(3) {
            height: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .level:nth-child(4) {
            height: auto;
            padding-top: 5px;
        }
    }

    /* =========================
       ARBORESCENCE (TAXONOMY)
    ========================= */
    .taxonomy-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        overflow-x: auto; /* Scroll horizontal sur mobile */
        padding-bottom: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        /* Scrollbar discrète */
        scrollbar-width: thin;
        scrollbar-color: #000 #f1f1f1;
    }

    .taxonomy {
        display: flex;
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        min-width: 600px; /* Force la largeur pour le scroll */
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 1rem 0;
    }

    .levels {
        margin-right: 20px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding-top: 0;
    }

    .level {
        background: transparent;
        color: #7d7c7c;
        padding-left: 0;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        text-align: left; /* Aligné gauche page */
        width: 140px;
        margin: 0;
        display: flex;
